<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
at June 30, 2024 the fair value of the Fourth Tranche Debentures&#8217; convertible feature amounted to $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ConvertibleDebtFairValueDisclosures_iI_c20240630__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--FourthTrancheDebentureConvertibleMember__us-gaap--FairValueByFairValueHierarchyLevelAxis__us-gaap--FairValueInputsLevel3Member_zUVx0uCzKba7" title="Fair value of debentures"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConvertibleDebtFairValueDisclosures" contextRef="AsOf2024-06-30_custom_FourthTrancheDebentureConvertibleMember_us-gaap_FairValueInputsLevel3Member" id="Fact001588" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">430,000</ix:nonFraction></span> (December 31, 2023 &#8211;
